from ground_author import *
add('b183','內支撐預壓、溫度軸力與分階段卸載~Strut preload, thermal axial force and staged unloading','深開挖內支撐預壓用來消除間隙並限制壁體位移，卻也會引入額外構件力與地層反力。本課將預壓目標、軸向剛度、溫度作用、座板接觸及鎖定損失分開討論，再用多支撐互制、第二階效應與卸載變位建立設計及現場量測的共同基準。~Preloading excavation struts closes gaps and limits wall movement while introducing additional member forces and ground reactions. The course separates preload targets, axial stiffness, temperature, seating and lock-off loss, then links strut interaction, second-order effects and unloading movement to common design and measurement baselines.',compact(r'''
接觸間隙~Contact gap || 支撐初次受力時，部分位移先消耗在座板、接頭及墊塊的接觸間隙，並非全都壓縮鋼構件。預壓可提早建立傳力路徑，但過高預壓會推動壁體或增加圍檁負擔；目標應由整體開挖變形與構件能力共同決定。~Initial strut movement partly closes gaps at seats, splices and packing rather than compressing the steel alone. Preload can establish the load path early, but excessive preload pushes the wall or overloads walers. The target must therefore follow overall excavation deformation and member resistance rather than a desire to maximize initial force. || 假設接觸後等效剛度k=200 kN/mm、力增量ΔP=600 kN，彈性縮短δ=ΔP/k=3 mm~For post-contact equivalent stiffness k=200 kN/mm and force increment ΔP=600 kN, elastic shortening δ=ΔP/k=3 mm || 同步記錄軸力及兩端相對位移，辨別接觸前的非線性段，再以接觸後斜率比較設計剛度。~Record force and relative end movement together, identify the nonlinear seating phase, and compare the post-contact slope with design stiffness. || 接觸未建立就讀取千斤頂壓力，可能誤判預壓已傳入支撐，卸壓後壁體仍有自由移動空間。~Reading jack pressure before contact is established can falsely indicate transferred preload while the wall retains free movement after unloading. || 千斤頂顯示目標壓力就代表所有接頭間隙已消除。~The target jack pressure proves every connection gap has closed. || 預壓驗收應同時保留力與位移曲線；接觸異常由臨時工程設計者核定修正，不以反覆加壓取代診斷。~Preload acceptance retains force and displacement curves; the temporary-works designer approves seating corrections rather than replacing diagnosis with repeated pressurization. || 線性式適用於接觸後的增量，不包含原始間隙閉合量；實際總行程還含壁體、圍檁與液壓設備的變形。~The linear expression applies to post-contact increments and excludes initial gap closure; total stroke also includes wall, waler and hydraulic-system deformation.
支撐軸向剛度~Strut axial stiffness || 鋼支撐的軸向剛度由材料模數、截面積及有效長度決定，長支撐即使強度足夠也可能有較大縮短。真實系統還包括接頭及壁體柔度，串聯柔度會降低整體剛度；用單根鋼管剛度代表完整支撐線可能低估開挖位移。~Axial stiffness depends on modulus, area and length, so a long strut can shorten substantially despite adequate strength. The system also includes splice and wall flexibility; serial compliances reduce overall stiffness. Using the steel member alone to represent the entire support line can therefore underestimate excavation movement and misrepresent load sharing. || 假設E=200 GPa、A=0.02 m²、L=20 m，k=EA/L=200 MN/m~For E=200 GPa, A=0.02 m² and L=20 m, k=EA/L=200 MN/m || 核對截面及長度，以接頭兩側位移和構件應變分離鋼材縮短與接合滑移，再比較等效剛度。~Verify section and length, separating steel shortening from splice slip using displacement on both sides of joints and member strain before comparing effective stiffness. || 未計接頭滑移會使預測支撐過硬，導致施工壁移超出模型，且力分配偏向其他較硬支撐。~Omitted splice slip makes predicted restraint too stiff, producing larger wall movement and transferring force toward other stiffer supports. || 截面越大，整條支撐系統就一定按相同比例變硬。~A larger member area makes the whole support system proportionally stiffer. || 分析模型應明列鋼材、接頭、圍檁與壁體柔度；變更接頭型式前由結構設計者重新核對整體剛度。~Identify steel, splice, waler and wall compliance in analysis; the structural designer reassesses system stiffness before a connection type changes. || 此式是均勻線彈性直桿剛度，不是挫屈容量；端部柔度、溫度及受力偏心需以另外的模型處理。~This is the stiffness of a uniform elastic axial member, not buckling resistance; end flexibility, temperature and eccentricity require separate models.
溫度附加軸力~Thermal axial force || 鋼支撐受日照或施工環境變化而伸縮，若兩端受到限制，熱變形會轉成附加軸力。完全拘束給出上限尺度，但壁體與接頭柔度會釋放部分熱應變；監測若未扣除溫度，可能把可逆熱力誤判為土壓需求突然增加。~Struts expand and contract with sunlight and construction conditions, generating axial force when restrained. Full restraint gives a bounding scale, while wall and connection flexibility release part of the thermal strain. Without temperature correction, monitoring may misinterpret reversible thermal force as a sudden increase in earth-pressure demand. || 完全拘束下E=200 GPa、A=0.02 m²、α=12×10⁻⁶/K、ΔT=10 K，ΔP=EAαΔT=480 kN~Under full restraint, E=200 GPa, A=0.02 m², α=12×10⁻⁶/K and ΔT=10 K give ΔP=EAαΔT=480 kN || 在受光及背光位置量測鋼溫，對時比對軸力與壁移，分辨日循環和持續增長的土壓作用。~Measure steel temperature in exposed and shaded locations, aligning force and wall movement to distinguish daily cycles from sustained earth-pressure growth. || 忽略熱力可能誤觸發警報，也可能在最高溫時低估支撐總軸力與挫屈需求。~Ignoring thermal force can cause false alarms or underestimate total axial and buckling demand at the highest temperature. || 支撐力隨白天上升就一定表示外側土壓增加。~A daytime rise in strut force necessarily indicates increasing earth pressure. || 軸力警戒應注明溫度基準與修正方式；設計者審核總力及去溫度趨勢，兩者都不可省略。~Force triggers state temperature reference and correction method; the designer reviews both total force and temperature-corrected trend, retaining neither as a substitute for the other. || 完全拘束式不能直接當場址預測，應用串聯剛度估計釋放程度；日照梯度也會引起彎曲，並非只有均勻軸力。~The fully restrained expression is not a direct site prediction; serial stiffness determines release, and solar gradients can induce bending as well as uniform axial force.
座板局部承壓~Seat bearing || 支撐軸力須經座板、加勁肋及圍檁傳到擋土壁，局部接觸面常比構件截面更容易控制。座板翹曲或墊塊不平會縮小有效面積並增加偏心；平均承壓只有在接觸分布合理時才能用來描述局部需求。~Strut force passes through seats, stiffeners and walers into the wall, and local contact may govern before the member section. Warped plates or uneven packing reduce effective area and increase eccentricity. Mean bearing pressure describes local demand only where the assumed contact distribution is credible. || 假設力P=800 kN、有效接觸A=0.04 m²，平均p=P/A=20000 kPa=20 MPa~For force P=800 kN over effective contact A=0.04 m², mean p=P/A=20000 kPa=20 MPa || 檢查接觸面平整及加勁位置，量測座板轉角，對照反力是否通過設計傳力中心。~Inspect contact flatness and stiffener location, measure seat rotation, and check whether the reaction passes through the intended transfer centre. || 小面積接觸可能導致混凝土局部壓碎或腹板屈曲，支撐本身尚有容量也無法維持整體傳力。~Small contact areas can crush concrete or buckle a web, interrupting the system load path despite remaining strut capacity. || 支撐桿件強度足夠，就不用檢查座板下的承壓。~Adequate strut strength eliminates the need to check bearing beneath its seat. || 預壓前必須驗收接觸及加勁細部；座板變形異常由連接設計者評估，不能只換更大的千斤頂。~Accept contact and stiffening before preload; the connection designer investigates seat deformation rather than responding with a larger jack. || 平均承壓不包含邊緣峰值與局部彎曲，承壓能力又取決於基材和拘束；實際接觸面須由細部及量測確認。~Mean pressure excludes edge peaks and local bending, while bearing resistance depends on substrate and confinement; details and measurements must establish actual contact area.
鎖定損失~Lock-off loss || 預壓由液壓設備轉移至機械鎖定後，楔塊坐入、墊片壓縮及接頭滑移會造成軸力損失。鎖定前讀值不是長期保留力，且溫度變化也會干擾比較；設計上需區分施加力、移交力與後續開挖引起的力增量。~Transferring preload from hydraulics to mechanical locking can lose force through wedge seating, packing compression and splice slip. The pre-lock reading is not retained force, and temperature changes complicate comparison. Design must distinguish applied force, transferred force and increments caused by subsequent excavation. || 假設施加P₀=800 kN、同溫鎖定後P₁=680 kN，損失比(P₀−P₁)/P₀=15%~For applied P₀=800 kN and same-temperature retained P₁=680 kN, loss ratio (P₀−P₁)/P₀=15% || 比較鎖定前後同一量測系統的軸力與位移，記錄溫度及座板狀態，確認損失是否持續發展。~Compare force and displacement before and after lock-off using the same system, recording temperature and seating condition to see whether losses continue. || 只記施加峰值會高估保留預壓，後續開挖時壁體可能先移動才重新接觸支撐。~Recording only the applied peak overstates retained preload, allowing the wall to move before restraint fully re-engages during excavation. || 鎖定前達到目標力就等於之後一直維持相同預壓。~Reaching the target before lock-off means the same preload remains indefinitely. || 驗收文件需列施加、鎖定及穩定後力值；超出核定損失範圍時由設計者查明原因後決定是否調整。~Acceptance records include applied, locked and stabilized forces; losses outside approved bounds require designer diagnosis before adjustment is decided. || 比例只描述這次力轉移，不是通用允許損失；應排除溫度及儀器漂移，並確認比較期間沒有其他支撐同步受力。~The ratio describes this transfer only, not an allowable loss; exclude temperature and sensor drift and confirm no other supports changed load during the comparison.
多支撐互制~Interaction between struts || 預壓一支支撐會推動圍檁與壁體，改變鄰近支撐的長度及軸力，因此各支撐並非互相獨立。施加順序及剛度差異決定反力分配，局部達到目標力可能同時使另一支卸載；整體平衡要以同一時間的力值判定。~Preloading one strut moves the waler and wall, changing neighbouring lengths and forces. Supports are therefore coupled through stiffness and sequence. Achieving a local target may unload another strut, so overall equilibrium must use simultaneous readings rather than peaks recorded at different times. || 假設本支撐增加ΔP₁=100 kN、鄰支撐減少60 kN，兩支合計增量ΔΣP=100−60=40 kN~If one strut gains ΔP₁=100 kN and its neighbour loses 60 kN, their combined increment is ΔΣP=100−60=40 kN || 同步讀取整個支撐層的力與圍檁位移，逐段比較力增量矩陣，核對反力總和及作用位置。~Read the complete support level simultaneously with waler movement, compare incremental interaction patterns, and check reaction sums and positions. || 把不同時間的峰值相加會虛構不存在的總支撐力，也可能漏掉某支已卸載而失去接觸。~Adding peaks from different times invents a total force that never existed and can conceal a strut that has unloaded and lost contact. || 每支支撐都曾達標，就表示整層目前一定同時達標。~If every strut once met its target, the entire level meets all targets simultaneously. || 預壓及複測順序應由臨時工程設計者指定，驗收採同時力場；不得以逐支歷史最大值取代。~The temporary-works designer specifies preload and recheck sequence, and acceptance uses a simultaneous force field rather than individual historical maxima. || 兩支力增量相加不代表整體水平平衡，還有其他支撐、土反力及力臂；需納入完整同時自由體圖。~Adding two increments does not establish overall horizontal equilibrium; other struts, soil reactions and lever arms remain, requiring a complete simultaneous free body.
第二階偏心~Second-order eccentricity || 受壓構件的初始彎曲與荷載偏心會產生彎矩，軸力作用在追加側移上又放大彎曲。支撐的穩定檢查因此不能只看平均軸應力，還要核對接頭對心、側向約束與實際彎曲方向；局部改動可使整個支撐線更敏感。~Initial bow and load eccentricity produce bending in a compression member, and axial force acting on additional lateral displacement amplifies it. Stability checks therefore require alignment, lateral restraint and actual bending direction as well as average axial stress. Local modifications can increase sensitivity of the entire support line. || 假設P=1000 kN、初偏心e₀=0.02 m、追加側移Δ=0.01 m，M=P(e₀+Δ)=30 kN·m~For P=1000 kN, initial eccentricity e₀=0.02 m and additional deflection Δ=0.01 m, M=P(e₀+Δ)=30 kN·m || 測量支撐直線度與接頭錯位，將側移和軸力同時輸入第二階分析，檢查側向繫材有效性。~Measure strut straightness and splice offset, input lateral displacement and force together into second-order analysis, and verify effective lateral ties. || 小偏心在高軸力下可形成顯著彎矩，局部側向支承失效會進一步放大變形並降低穩定餘裕。~Small eccentricity under high compression produces significant bending; lost lateral support further magnifies deformation and reduces stability margin. || 壓力只沿支撐軸線傳遞，所以量到側彎也可忽略。~Compression acts only axially, so observed lateral bow can be ignored. || 不直度及接頭偏心應納入安裝驗收；超差處由構件設計者確認修正，不能依外觀判斷仍可使用。~Include straightness and splice eccentricity in installation acceptance; the member designer approves correction of deviations rather than judging usability by appearance. || 此式是已知變形下的附加彎矩，沒有自行求出失穩點；實際分析還需剛度、端部條件及材料非線性。~This expression gives added moment for a known deflection and does not solve instability; actual analysis also needs stiffness, end conditions and material nonlinearity.
液壓力校正~Hydraulic-force calibration || 千斤頂壓力乘有效活塞面積可估施力，但回油側壓力、摩擦及校正誤差會使真實力偏離理想值。壓力表量到的是液壓系統狀態，不能獨立證明支撐已受力；應與載重計或構件應變以及位移同步比對。~Pressure times effective piston area estimates jack force, but return pressure, friction and calibration error alter actual output. A pressure gauge measures the hydraulic system rather than independently proving force in the strut. Compare it with a load cell or member strain and with displacement on a synchronized time base. || 假設有效差壓p=20 MPa、有效活塞面積A=0.04 m²，F=pA=0.8 MN=800 kN~For effective differential pressure p=20 MPa and piston area A=0.04 m², F=pA=0.8 MN=800 kN || 核對活塞有效面積與校正證書，在核定範圍比對獨立載重計，檢查升降載遲滯及讀值零點。~Verify effective piston area and calibration certificates, compare with an independent load cell within the approved range, and check loading-unloading hysteresis and zero offsets. || 用錯活塞面積或忽略回壓會錯估預壓，摩擦遲滯又可能使升載與降載呈不同力值。~Wrong piston area or ignored backpressure misstates preload, while friction hysteresis gives different forces during loading and unloading. || 壓力表讀值乘任何外徑面積都能得到精確支撐力。~Gauge pressure times any external cylinder area gives exact strut force. || 每組千斤頂、壓力表及載重計應有配對編碼；設備更換後由試驗負責人重核轉換關係再使用。~Pair-code each jack, gauge and load cell; the testing lead rechecks the conversion after equipment changes before further use. || 理想公式假設差壓已扣除回壓且忽略摩擦，不是張拉操作程序；現場施力與停留點必須依核定設備和臨時工程方案。~The ideal equation assumes backpressure is already removed and neglects friction; it is not an operating procedure, and force application follows approved equipment and temporary-works plans.
壁移速率~Wall movement rate || 開挖壁移除了累積量，變化速率及與支撐受力的相位也能協助診斷。位移持續加速可能代表支承尚未形成、土體潛變或地下水變化；短時間跳點則需先排除測量基準或儀器問題，不能把所有異常都歸因於地層失穩。~Cumulative wall movement, rate and timing relative to strut force all aid diagnosis. Sustained acceleration may indicate incomplete restraint, soil creep or groundwater changes, whereas a sudden isolated jump first requires checks of datum and instrument integrity. Not every anomalous reading establishes ground instability, but trends must not be dismissed without evidence. || 假設位移由5 mm增至8 mm，間隔Δt=6 h，平均速率v=(8−5)/6=0.5 mm/h~For displacement increasing from 5 mm to 8 mm over Δt=6 h, mean rate v=(8−5)/6=0.5 mm/h || 比對傾度計、獨立測量及開挖日誌，檢查讀值是否同向持續，並同步查看支撐力與外水頭。~Compare inclinometers, independent survey and excavation logs for persistent directional movement while checking strut force and external head simultaneously. || 只設總位移警報可能錯過快速惡化，過度平滑資料又會掩蓋施工事件造成的短時加速。~A cumulative-only trigger can miss rapid deterioration, while excessive smoothing conceals short-term acceleration associated with construction events. || 累積位移仍低於警戒值，就不必注意位移速率。~Movement rate is irrelevant while cumulative displacement remains below its trigger. || 監測計畫應並列累積量、速率及資料品質檢查；異常由地工與臨時工程負責人共同判讀後決定下一階段。~Monitoring plans include cumulative movement, rate and data-quality checks; geotechnical and temporary-works leads jointly interpret anomalies before deciding the next stage. || 兩點平均速率不能顯示期間加速或峰值，也不是通用停工值；需依資產敏感度與施工反應時間訂定判據。~A two-point mean rate hides intermediate acceleration and peaks and is not a universal stop value; criteria depend on asset sensitivity and response time.
卸載回彈~Unloading rebound || 永久樓板或其他支承接管荷載後，內支撐卸載會釋放儲存彈性能，使壁體及連接產生回彈。回彈方向與既有塑性變形不一定相同，不能假設解除預壓就回到施工前的位置；卸載分析需包含替代支承剛度與接觸狀態。~When permanent slabs or other restraints take over, strut unloading releases stored elastic energy and causes wall and connection rebound. The rebound need not reverse accumulated plastic deformation or restore the original position. Analysis must include replacement-support stiffness and contact state rather than treating preload removal as a simple return to zero. || 假設釋放力ΔP=600 kN、等效卸載剛度k=150 MN/m，回彈δ=ΔP/k=0.004 m=4 mm~For released force ΔP=600 kN and unloading stiffness k=150 MN/m, rebound δ=ΔP/k=0.004 m=4 mm || 量測卸載期間的支撐力、壁移及永久樓板應變，確認荷載確實移交到核定構件而非失去支承。~Measure strut force, wall movement and permanent-slab strain during unloading to verify actual transfer to approved members rather than loss of restraint. || 未形成替代力流就卸載，可能使壁體向開挖內變形並損傷接縫，無法用重新加壓完全消除。~Unloading before a replacement path exists can move the wall inward and damage joints, with effects that reloading may not fully reverse. || 卸載是把力減少，所以不需要像加載一樣分析。~Unloading reduces force, so it needs no analysis comparable to loading. || 拆撐前由臨時及永久結構設計者共同簽認接管條件；保留卸載曲線及殘餘位移作為營運基準。~Temporary and permanent designers jointly sign off takeover conditions before removal; retain unloading curves and residual movement as the operational baseline. || 回彈估算假設線性卸載且接觸不變，未含塑性、摩擦與土體時效；不能把四毫米直接當許可的卸載變位。~The rebound estimate assumes linear unloading and unchanged contact, excluding plasticity, friction and time effects; four millimetres is not an authorized unloading movement.
'''),'原創教學例：假設支撐接觸後的等效剛度k=200 kN/mm，施加力增量ΔP=600 kN，彈性縮短δ=ΔP/k=3 mm。保持剛度不變，力增量提高10%至660 kN，縮短為3.3 mm。實際千斤頂行程還包含座板間隙、圍檁、壁體及設備變形，因此不能用這個三毫米推定全部接觸已閉合。驗證應將力與兩端位移同步記錄，先辨識接觸前後剛度變化，再檢查保留預壓、溫度軸力和鄰支撐互制。這些值是原創假設，不是現場施壓指令。~Original teaching example: assume post-contact support stiffness k=200 kN/mm and force increment ΔP=600 kN, giving elastic shortening δ=ΔP/k=3 mm. With stiffness fixed, a 10% increase to 660 kN gives 3.3 mm. Actual jack stroke also includes seating gaps, waler deformation, wall movement and equipment compliance, so this shortening cannot establish complete contact. Verification records force and both end movements simultaneously, identifies the stiffness change at seating, then checks retained preload, thermal force and interaction with neighbouring struts. These are original assumptions rather than instructions for applying force on site.',['fhwa-anchors','geo-site','geo-wall','keller-tech'],['Crossrail深車站：多層支撐比較~Crossrail deep stations: multilevel-bracing comparison','倫敦哈利街地下室：受限空間比較~Harley Street basement: restricted-space comparison'])

add('b184','地錨自由伸長、錨碇傳力與試驗可識別性~Anchor free extension, bond transfer and test identifiability','地錨試驗的位移同時包含自由段伸長、錨碇段變形與座頭滑移，不能由單一荷重或總位移推定錨固品質。本課把穩定錨碇區、拉力分量、潛變、腐蝕與群體作用逐一拆開，最後以座入損失及完整試驗證據確認地錨的長期功能。~Anchor-test movement combines free-length extension, bond-zone deformation and head slip, so one load or displacement does not establish anchorage quality. The course separates stable anchorage, force components, creep, corrosion and group action, then uses seating losses and complete test evidence to assess long-term anchor function.',compact(r'''
自由段伸長~Free-length extension || 自由段讓鋼腱在不與周圍漿體黏結的區間彈性伸長，張力才能有效傳到遠端錨碇區。試驗伸長比預期小，可能代表自由段黏住或有效長度不足；比預期大則可能包含座頭滑移、鋼材模數差異或錨碇段移動。~The free length allows elastic tendon extension without bond to surrounding grout, transferring tension to the distant anchorage zone. Less extension than expected may indicate unintended bond or inadequate effective length; excessive movement may include head slip, modulus differences or movement within the bond zone. || 假設P=600 kN、自由長Lf=12 m、E=195 GPa、鋼面積A=0.001 m²，δ=PLf/(EA)=0.0369 m=36.9 mm~For P=600 kN, free length Lf=12 m, E=195 GPa and steel area A=0.001 m², δ=PLf/(EA)=0.0369 m=36.9 mm || 以獨立基準量測腱端位移，扣除座頭變形後比較彈性卸載回復量與理論自由伸長。~Measure tendon-end movement from an independent reference, subtract head deformation and compare elastic unloading recovery with theoretical free extension. || 自由段局部黏結可能讓錨力過早傳入滑動土體，拉力讀值合格仍不能提供設計的整體穩定作用。~Unintended free-length bond may transfer force prematurely into moving ground; an acceptable tension reading then fails to provide the intended overall stabilization. || 地錨達到試驗荷重就代表自由段長度一定正確。~Reaching test load proves that anchor free length is correct. || 試驗報告需保留升降載曲線與基準穩定證據；地工設計者確認自由伸長範圍後才接受地錨。~Retain loading-unloading curves and reference-stability evidence; the geotechnical designer confirms the free-extension range before accepting the anchor. || 此式假設鋼材彈性且自由段不黏結，量到的總位移還包括其他柔度；不能用總位移直接倒推唯一自由長度。~The expression assumes elastic steel and unbonded free length; measured total movement includes other compliance and cannot uniquely identify free length by itself.
錨碇平均剪應力~Mean bond shear || 錨碇段透過鋼腱與漿體、漿體與地層兩個界面把張力傳入穩定土岩。平均剪應力可作尺度檢查，實際沿長度的分布並不均勻，近端先動員後可能逐步滑移；增加錨碇長度也不保證容量一直線性增加。~The bond zone transfers tendon force through tendon-grout and grout-ground interfaces into stable soil or rock. Mean bond shear checks scale, but distribution along the length is nonuniform and may progressively slip after mobilizing near the loaded end. Increasing bond length therefore does not guarantee indefinitely linear capacity growth. || 假設P=600 kN、漿體直徑D=0.15 m、錨碇長Lb=8 m，平均τ=P/(πDLb)=159 kPa~For P=600 kN, grout diameter D=0.15 m and bond length Lb=8 m, mean τ=P/(πDLb)=159 kPa || 結合鑽孔地層、注漿紀錄及載重試驗，檢查錨碇區是否均在設計地層，觀察持載位移是否穩定。~Combine bore geology, grouting records and load tests to confirm the bond zone lies in the intended stratum and assess sustained-load movement stability. || 假設直徑大於實際或錨碇區跨入弱層，會高估有效接觸面積，造成漿土界面逐步滑移。~Overstated diameter or a bond zone crossing weak soil exaggerates effective area and may allow progressive grout-ground slip. || 平均黏結應力低就表示每個位置都不會局部滑移。~Low average bond stress prevents local slip at every position. || 設計黏結參數須由代表性試驗支持；地層異常與注漿量偏差應交地工設計者核定錨碇長度。~Support design bond parameters with representative tests; the geotechnical designer reviews anomalous strata and grout volumes before confirming bond length. || 平均剪應力不是可直接使用的黏結強度，兩個界面及鋼材都要檢查；短期試驗結果亦不能自動涵蓋長期潛變。~Mean shear is not a usable bond strength; both interfaces and steel require checks, and short-term testing does not automatically cover long-term creep.
試驗位移組成~Test-movement components || 試驗儀器讀到的是整套載重鏈的變形，包括鋼腱伸長、座頭壓縮、楔片滑移及錨碇區移動。不同成分可能有可逆及不可逆部分，必須透過獨立測點與卸載回復辨別；把總位移全歸給自由段會掩蓋錨固異常。~The instrument measures deformation of the full loading chain: tendon extension, head compression, wedge slip and bond-zone movement. These components include reversible and irreversible parts, requiring independent points and unloading recovery for separation. Assigning total movement to the free length alone can conceal anchorage defects. || 假設自由段伸長δf=36.9 mm、座頭變形δh=3.0 mm且無其他變形，δtotal=δf+δh=39.9 mm~With free extension δf=36.9 mm, head deformation δh=3.0 mm and no other movement, δtotal=δf+δh=39.9 mm || 分別量測腱端、承壓板及獨立基準位移，將可逆回復與殘餘位移分列，確認反力架本身穩定。~Measure tendon end, bearing plate and independent reference separately, separating elastic recovery and residual movement and verifying reaction-frame stability. || 反力架或量測基準移動會造成假伸長，可能誤判自由段合格或把不穩定錨固當作材料彈性。~Reaction-frame or datum movement creates false extension and can misclassify unstable anchorage as acceptable free-length or material elasticity. || 試驗位移計只會讀到鋼腱本身的彈性伸長。~The test displacement gauge reads only elastic tendon extension. || 測點配置圖應與儀器校正一併核准；試驗負責人確認基準未受反力影響後，再把資料交設計者判讀。~Approve the measurement layout with calibration; the testing lead confirms that reaction loads do not affect the datum before submitting results for design interpretation. || 相加模型依賴各位移的方向與共同基準，未量測的錨碇滑移不能預設為零；算例僅示範如何分解量測。~The sum requires consistent directions and datum; unmeasured bond slip cannot be assumed zero, and the exercise only illustrates decomposition of observations.
穩定區錨碇~Anchorage in stable ground || 地錨必須把力傳過潛在滑動面，錨碇區若仍在可移動土體內，只會拉緊同一塊不穩定土。穩定區位置依地下水、開挖及地震情境而變，單一最短距離並不足夠；應在三維剖面上核對自由段與錨碇段相對各失穩面的位置。~Anchors must transfer force beyond potential slip surfaces. A bond zone inside moving ground merely tightens the same unstable mass. Stable-zone location changes with groundwater, excavation and seismic cases, so one minimum distance is insufficient; check free and bond lengths against relevant three-dimensional failure surfaces. || 假設沿錨軸滑面交點距頭部16 m、錨碇末端22 m，滑面後長度L=22−16=6 m~If a slip surface intersects the anchor axis 16 m from the head and the bond end is at 22 m, length beyond the surface is 6 m || 以鑽孔及地層模型確認滑面位置，檢查不利水位與施工階段下的變化，將錨碇段逐支投影。~Confirm failure-surface position using borings and the ground model, assess adverse water levels and construction stages, and project each bond zone individually. || 採用錯誤滑面位置會把有效錨長算得過長，整體滑動時地錨可能與擋土體一起位移。~An incorrect slip surface overstates effective anchorage length, allowing anchors and the retained mass to move together during global instability. || 錨碇段越長就一定能補償它位於滑動土體內的問題。~A longer bond zone always compensates for being located within moving ground. || 地錨圖應標出主要及敏感度滑面；地下水或開挖深度變更時，由地工設計者重新核對穩定區。~Anchor drawings show principal and sensitivity slip surfaces; groundwater or excavation-depth changes require geotechnical review of stable anchorage zones. || 六米只是幾何位於滑面後的長度，不是已證明的有效黏結長；需確認該段材料、注漿完整性及群體穩定。~Six metres is geometric length beyond the surface, not demonstrated effective bond length; material, grout continuity and group stability still require confirmation.
傾角分力~Inclination components || 斜地錨同時提供水平及垂直分力，水平分力抵抗擋土需求，垂直分力則進入牆體與基礎。角度增加可能增加向下荷載而減少水平效率，錨頭局部承壓及牆趾承載因此需要一起評估，不能只看鋼腱拉力大小。~An inclined anchor supplies horizontal and vertical components. The horizontal component resists retaining demand, while the vertical component enters the wall and foundation. Steeper inclination can increase downward loading while reducing horizontal efficiency, requiring combined assessment of head bearing and toe capacity rather than tendon force alone. || 張力T=600 kN、對水平夾角θ=25°，H=Tcosθ=544 kN，V=Tsinθ=254 kN~For tension T=600 kN at θ=25° below horizontal, H=Tcosθ=544 kN and V=Tsinθ=254 kN || 量測實際錨頭方向與鑽孔傾角，核對牆體承壓細部及基礎垂直反力，檢查是否與模型一致。~Measure actual head direction and bore inclination, checking wall-bearing details and foundation vertical reactions against the model. || 忽略垂直分力會低估牆體軸力或基礎需求，角度誤差也可能讓錨頭承壓產生偏心。~Omitting the vertical component understates wall axial or foundation demand, and angular error can introduce eccentric head bearing. || 所有地錨張力都可以直接當成水平擋土支撐力。~All anchor tension can be counted directly as horizontal retaining resistance. || 任何錨角變更都須同步更新水平效率與垂直荷載；牆體及地工設計者共同確認後才核准。~Every angle change updates horizontal efficiency and vertical loading; wall and geotechnical designers jointly confirm the revised arrangement before approval. || 分力分解只處理力方向，未評估錨頭偏心或牆體變形相容；兩個分量必須放入同一結構自由體圖。~Component resolution addresses direction only, not head eccentricity or wall compatibility; both components must enter the same structural free body.
持載潛變~Sustained-load creep || 地錨在固定荷載下仍可能因土體潛變、漿土界面滑移或鋼腱鬆弛而產生位移。位移對時間對數的斜率可用於比較持載階段，但不同荷載與時間區間不能混用；量測須排除溫度及反力架變形的影響。~Anchors can move under constant load through soil creep, interface slip and tendon relaxation. Displacement versus logarithmic time helps compare hold stages, but different load levels and time intervals are not interchangeable. Temperature effects and reaction-frame movement must be separated before interpreting the trend as anchorage creep. || 假設t₁=1 min時δ₁=1.2 mm、t₂=10 min時δ₂=2.1 mm，斜率α=(δ₂−δ₁)/log₁₀(t₂/t₁)=0.9 mm/對數週期~For δ₁=1.2 mm at t₁=1 min and δ₂=2.1 mm at t₂=10 min, α=(δ₂−δ₁)/log₁₀(t₂/t₁)=0.9 mm per logarithmic cycle || 保持核定試驗荷載並精確記時，用獨立位移基準及溫度資料檢查持載趨勢，避免中途重設零點。~Maintain the approved test load and precise timing, using an independent movement reference and temperature records to assess hold trends without rezeroing mid-stage. || 位移持續加速可能表示黏結區逐步破壞；若只讀起終點而漏掉中間資料，會錯過不穩定變化。~Accelerating movement may indicate progressive bond failure; reading only endpoints misses unstable behaviour within the hold period. || 固定荷重時出現的位移全部都是鋼腱彈性伸長。~All movement under constant load is elastic tendon extension. || 潛變判據應引用核定試驗程序的荷載與時距；試驗負責人將完整時間序列交地工設計者判定。~Creep criteria reference the approved test load and timing; the testing lead supplies the full time series for geotechnical interpretation. || 對數斜率只適用於指定持載區間，不能直接外推多年壽命；此數值不是任何規範的通用合格上限。~The logarithmic slope applies to the specified hold interval and cannot directly predict years of life; this number is not a universal code acceptance limit.
腐蝕截面損失~Corrosion area loss || 地錨鋼腱承受長期拉力，腐蝕不只減少截面，也可能因點蝕形成應力集中。圓鋼直徑均勻減少的平方關係可說明面積敏感度，真實多股鋼絞線卻常呈不均勻損傷，防蝕套管、錨頭密封與排水因此需要連續管理。~Tendons carry sustained tension, and corrosion both reduces area and introduces pitting stress concentrations. The squared relation for uniform circular diameter loss illustrates area sensitivity, but multistrand tendons often deteriorate nonuniformly. Sheathing, head sealing and drainage therefore require continuity of protection and long-term management. || 假設圓鋼直徑剩原值90%，面積比A₂/A₁=(0.90)²=0.81，均勻面積損失19%~If a circular bar retains 90% of original diameter, A₂/A₁=(0.90)²=0.81, representing 19% uniform area loss || 檢查可接近錨頭的密封與積水，依核定方法評估鋼材狀態，將局部點蝕與均勻損失分開紀錄。~Inspect accessible head seals and standing water, assess steel condition using approved methods, and record localized pitting separately from uniform loss. || 密封破損可讓水沿套管進入，外部錨頭外觀良好仍可能有隱藏腐蝕與拉力能力下降。~A broken seal can admit water along the sheath; a sound-looking external head may coexist with concealed corrosion and reduced tension capacity. || 鋼腱直徑減少百分之十，面積也只減少百分之十。~Ten-percent tendon diameter loss produces only ten-percent area loss. || 交接應列防蝕系統、可檢查部位與異常處置責任；發現密封失效時由地錨設計者核定檢測及修復範圍。~Handover identifies protection systems, inspectable areas and response responsibility; the anchor designer determines testing and repair when sealing fails. || 面積比不是殘餘拉力能力保證，點蝕、應力腐蝕與鋼絞線斷絲可能更不利；不可僅按平均直徑折減。~Area ratio does not guarantee residual tensile resistance; pitting, stress corrosion and broken wires may be more adverse than a mean-diameter reduction.
地錨群體作用~Anchor-group interaction || 多支地錨的錨碇區若互相重疊，地層應力與潛在破壞面會互相影響，單支試驗容量不能直接乘支數。群體效率可作簡化比較，但實際效果取決於間距、方向、層位與載入順序，必須與整體滑動及土體變形共同檢查。~Overlapping anchorage zones interact through ground stress and potential failure surfaces, so single-anchor test capacity cannot automatically be multiplied by anchor count. Group efficiency gives a simplified comparison, but spacing, orientation, strata and loading sequence govern the actual effect, requiring checks of overall movement and ground deformation. || 假設4支各R=600 kN、合成群體效率η=0.8，Rgroup=η×4R=1920 kN~For four anchors each with R=600 kN and assumed group efficiency η=0.8, Rgroup=η×4R=1920 kN || 在三維圖上檢查錨碇區間距，對比不同錨的試驗與監測反應，核對共同滑面及鄰地權界線。~Check bond-zone spacing in three dimensions, compare test and monitoring responses between anchors, and assess common slip surfaces and property boundaries. || 群體錨碇區形成共同破壞體時，單支都曾試驗合格仍可能整體滑動，力分配也會變得不均。~A common failure mass can move despite individual test passes, and interaction can produce unequal force distribution among anchors. || 多支地錨總容量永遠等於每支容量直接相加。~Total capacity of several anchors always equals the direct sum of individual capacities. || 群體效率與錨距應有分析或試驗依據；新增地錨前由地工設計者重審共同破壞機制及地下界面。~Support group efficiency and spacing with analysis or tests; the geotechnical designer reviews common failure mechanisms and underground interfaces before anchors are added. || 效率係數是本例假設，不是固定材料性質；群體穩定不能只靠一個折減值取代失穩面與變形分析。~The efficiency is assumed for this exercise rather than a fixed material property; one reduction factor cannot replace group failure-surface and deformation analysis.
錨頭座入損失~Head-seating loss || 錨頭楔片座入或承壓構件壓縮會縮短鋼腱有效伸長，造成鎖定力下降。自由段越短，同樣座入量引起的力損失越大，因為軸向剛度較高；施加峰值因此需要與鎖定後實際保留力分開記錄。~Wedge seating or bearing-component compression reduces tendon extension and retained force. For the same seating movement, a shorter free length loses more force because axial stiffness is higher. The applied peak must therefore be recorded separately from the force actually retained after lock-off and verified against the intended load-transfer state. || E=195 GPa、A=0.001 m²、自由長Lf=12 m、座入s=0.002 m，ΔP=EAs/Lf=32.5 kN~For E=195 GPa, A=0.001 m², Lf=12 m and seating s=0.002 m, ΔP=EAs/Lf=32.5 kN || 量測鎖定前後腱端與承壓板的相對位移，對照載重計或核定提離試驗，排除溫度變化。~Measure relative tendon-end and bearing-plate movement across lock-off, compare with load cells or approved lift-off testing, and separate temperature changes. || 座入未計入會使保留力不足，後續牆體位移才重新動員地錨，失去預力限制變形的效果。~Omitted seating loss leaves insufficient retained force, requiring later wall movement to remobilize the anchor and reducing its deformation-control benefit. || 座入量很小，所以不可能顯著影響短自由段地錨。~Small seating movement cannot significantly affect a short-free-length anchor. || 驗收需保留座入與保留力紀錄；地錨設計者核定補償及再驗證條件，現場不得只追求較高峰值。~Acceptance retains seating and retained-force records; the anchor designer approves compensation and reverification rather than pursuing a higher peak alone. || 線彈性式未含摩擦與錨碇段變形，並假設座入全轉成自由段回縮；實測保留力仍是必要的獨立證據。~The elastic expression excludes friction and bond deformation and assumes all seating shortens the free segment; measured retained force remains necessary independent evidence.
試驗文件覆蓋~Test-evidence coverage || 地錨的隱蔽性使施工與試驗文件成為長期可追溯性的核心，缺少一支資料不能由其他地錨平均合格來補足。資料完整率有助找出待處理清單，卻不代表品質合格率；荷重程序、校正、時間及地層證據都須逐支核對。~Because anchors are concealed, construction and test records are central to traceability. Missing evidence for one anchor cannot be replaced by average compliance elsewhere. Completeness ratios identify unresolved items but are not quality-pass rates; loading procedure, calibration, timing and geological evidence must be checked anchor by anchor. || 假設應有50支地錨完整紀錄、已確認48支，文件覆蓋率48/50=96%，仍有2支未解決~If complete records are required for fifty anchors and forty-eight are confirmed, coverage is 48/50=96%, leaving two unresolved || 將每支地錨編碼連結鑽孔、注漿、材料與試驗資料，抽核原始曲線及簽認，保留缺件清單。~Link each anchor identifier to drilling, grout, material and test evidence, audit original curves and signatures, and retain an explicit missing-record list. || 只報高完整率可能掩蓋關鍵位置缺乏證據，日後維修時無法判斷原有荷載與防蝕系統。~Reporting only a high completeness rate can conceal missing evidence at critical locations, preventing later interpretation of original loading and corrosion protection. || 文件完整率達到百分之九十六就等於全部地錨合格。~Ninety-six-percent documentation coverage means every anchor is acceptable. || 未解決地錨須逐支指定責任及補證方式；地工設計者與業主確認處置後，才可完成正式移交。~Assign responsibility and a resolution method to every unresolved anchor; formal handover follows joint confirmation by the geotechnical designer and owner. || 比率只描述資料覆蓋，不衡量試驗結果或構造安全；缺少資料的地錨須保留未判定狀態，不可自動補成通過。~The ratio describes evidence coverage, not test outcome or structural safety; anchors with missing evidence remain unresolved rather than being automatically marked as passing.
'''),'原創教學例：假設地錨自由長Lf=12 m、鋼面積A=0.001 m²、彈性模數E=195 GPa，在P=600 kN時，理論自由伸長δ=PLf/(EA)=36.92 mm。若張力提高10%至660 kN而其他量固定，δ=40.62 mm，也提高10%。這只對自由段線彈性伸長成立，試驗總位移還含座頭坐入、反力架及錨碇變形。應以獨立基準和卸載回復分離各成分，不能把總位移直接倒算為唯一自由長度，更不能用此算例作現場試驗荷載指令。~Original teaching example: take free length Lf=12 m, steel area A=0.001 m² and modulus E=195 GPa. At P=600 kN, theoretical free extension is δ=PLf/(EA)=36.92 mm. Increasing force by 10% to 660 kN with other inputs fixed gives 40.62 mm, also a 10% increase. This applies only to elastic free-segment extension. Total test movement also includes head seating, reaction-frame motion and bond-zone deformation. Separate these using independent references and unloading recovery; total movement cannot uniquely identify free length, and these assumed numbers do not prescribe a field test load.',['fhwa-anchors','geo-site','geo-wall'],['倫敦哈利街地下室：擋土錨定比較~Harley Street basement: retaining-anchor comparison','Crossrail深車站：支撐方案比較~Crossrail deep stations: support-option comparison'])
if __name__=='__main__': write()
